BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: North Bay Contra Dance
UID:event_314496463@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260501T040826Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260501T050000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260501T060000
SUMMARY:May Morn Morris and Community Dance
DESCRIPTION:North Bay Contra Dance\nFor more than a quarter century Apple 
 Tree Morris has danced the sun up behind the **Sebastopol Community Center
  Annex**. Participate in community dances led by Kalia Kliban accompanied 
 by Jon Berger\, with bagpipe provided by Robert Davis at the crucial-momen
 t! (You’ll have to come to see what that means…)\n**Arrive at 5am** to
  experience the fullness of the transition from the dark to the light. You
 ’ll be so glad you came! Check out our gallery and sign up for our maili
 ng list at [appletreemorris.org](https://appletreemorris.org/)!\nDancing a
 t dawn on [Beltane](https://www.cpre.org.uk/discover/the-origins-of-may-da
 y-and-beltane/)\, the 1st of May\, is an old agricultural custom in Englan
 d. After the long winter\, May signals the lush blooming of spring and the
  promise of the summer to come!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-contra-dance/events/3144964
 63/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260426T194706Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260426T194706Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: North Bay Contra Dance
UID:event_314496496@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260501T040826Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260503T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260503T160000
SUMMARY:English Country Dance Sebastopol
DESCRIPTION:North Bay Contra Dance\nEnglish country dancing is done in lon
 g lines (like contra)\, circles\, or in geometric sets (squares\, triangle
 s). Like our contra dances\, there is live music and a caller. You can com
 e by yourself or with friends\, since we change partners after each dance.
  If you’ve ever done contra or square dancing\, much of our dance vocabu
 lary will be familiar to you since both of those styles evolved from Engli
 sh country dancing.\n\nThe dance is held the 1st and 3rd Sundays of each m
 onth\, 2-4:30 pm\, to live music\, all levels of experience welcome\; and 
 occasional 5th Sundays for Advanced dancers. Admission is $15 for non-memb
 ers\, $13 for members of NBCDS and its affiliates\, $5 for dancers 30 and 
 younger.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-contra-dance/events/3144964
 96/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260426T195118Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260426T195118Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: North Bay Contra Dance
UID:event_314496544@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260501T040826Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260503T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260503T213000
SUMMARY:Petaluma Contra Dance
DESCRIPTION:North Bay Contra Dance\nContra Dance is fun\, quick to learn\,
  and great exercise. Every dance night has a live band\, caller\, and a qu
 ick start class for first timers.\nIn contra dance\, you will dance with y
 our partner but also with other couples as you progress down the line. The
  figures for each dance are done in a repeated sequence after a brief walk
  through by the caller. Each dance may last 10 – 12 minutes and then we 
 encourage you to switch partners as the night goes on.\nWhat to wear: Comf
 ortable shoes that will enable you to pivot and slide on the wood floor.\n
 When to arrive: If this is your first time\, come 30 minutes early to chec
 k in\, join the quick start class\, and get you ready for the first dance.
 \nHow hard to learn? Most newcomers will find that they can get dancing ri
 ght away as the figures are quite simple.\nCome as a group\, couple\, or s
 ingle! Our dance is inclusive to all ages and genders.\nCost: $15 members\
 , $20 non-members\, $10 student or limited income.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-contra-dance/events/3144965
 44/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260426T195843Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260426T195843Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
